 196:Libs/mbedtls/library/constant_time.c **** /** Constant-flow "greater than" comparison:
 197:Libs/mbedtls/library/constant_time.c ****  * return x > y
 198:Libs/mbedtls/library/constant_time.c ****  *
 199:Libs/mbedtls/library/constant_time.c ****  * This is equivalent to \p x > \p y, but is likely to be compiled
 200:Libs/mbedtls/library/constant_time.c ****  * to code using bitwise operation rather than a branch.
 201:Libs/mbedtls/library/constant_time.c ****  *
 202:Libs/mbedtls/library/constant_time.c ****  * \param x     The first value to analyze.
 203:Libs/mbedtls/library/constant_time.c ****  * \param y     The second value to analyze.
